+# T85 Result
+
+## Files created/modified
+
+- Created `docs/architecture/2026-05-16-successor-architecture-overview.md`
+- Created `docs/architecture/2026-05-16-memory-model-reference.md`
+- Created `docs/architecture/2026-05-16-event-log-design.md`
+- Created `docs/architecture/2026-05-16-consolidation-design.md`
+- Created `docs/architecture/2026-05-16-retrieval-ranking-design.md`
+- Created `docs/architecture/2026-05-16-verification-freshness-design.md`
+- Created `docs/operator-guide/2026-05-16-operator-guide.md`
+- Created `docs/operator-guide/2026-05-16-migration-from-lattice.md`
+- Created `docs/operator-guide/2026-05-16-benchmark-evaluation-guide.md`
+- Created `docs/operator-guide/2026-05-16-extension-review-ui-guide.md`
+- Created `docs/plans/2026-05-16-cognitive-workspace-fork-build/results/T85.md`
+
